! DBG113L.DBG - a line step ending at a RET whose return is in the middle of
! the caller's line (README.md): TWICE is one line, two CALLS of SUBC.
SET BREAK ENDC
GO
SHOW CALLS
!> STEP from SUBC's RET: into the middle of TWICE's line
STEP
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE .PC
!> STEP again: over the second CALLS
STEP
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE .PC
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
